oan-payments-issuer\",\n              \"audiences\": [\"loan-payments-api\"],\n              \"keys\": [{ \"kty\": \"oct\", \"k\": \"bG9hbi1wYXltZW50cy10ZXN0LXNlY3JldC1zaWduaW5nLXN0cmluZw\" }]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nIt reads the catalog test data (environment \"test\") and uses a fixed dev JWT issuer, audience and HS256 key. Declare `dev` as an environment in run-tests.sh so `./run-tests.sh --compile --env dev` compiles the loan-payments sub-project with loan-payments-shared-package.json + loan-payments-dev-package.json. Document the dev package and how to run it locally in README.md.\n=====INVENTORY=====\n# Repository inventory\n\nGenerated by the orchestrator for project `loan-payments`. Everything listed here is mounted **READ-ONLY** \u2014 it is reference material, not yours to change.\n\nRules:\n- **Never** create, edit, copy or delete anything under these directories.\n- **Never** copy their files into your project \u2014 include shared modules via `script.include`.\n- **Never** read their `build/` directories (compiler output; excluded from this inventory).\n- Read a directory's README first (when present), then its `.sqrl` files, then its `package.json`.\n\n## `data-catalog` \u2014 SHARED MODULE\n\n_declared under script.include by customer_\n\n- Main script: `ontology.sqrl`\n- Engines: `flink`, `postgres`, `vertx`\n- Package configs: `ontology-shared-package.json`, `ontology-test-package.json`\n- Include via `script.include`: `\"data_catalog\": { \"package\": \"../data-catalog/ontology-shared-package.json\" }` (any top-level package file of the module works)\n- SQRL files: `customer/customer-ontology.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_enriched-prod.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_enriched-test.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_enriched.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_master-prod.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_master-test.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/customer_master.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/kyc_aml-prod.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/kyc_aml-test.sqrl`, `customer/customer_data/kyc_aml.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_analytics-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_analytics-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_analytics.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_balances-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_balances-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/account_balances.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/deposit_accounts-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/deposit_accounts-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/accounts/deposit_accounts.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/deposits_payments-ontology.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/card_transactions-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/card_transactions-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/card_transactions.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/core_transactions-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/core_transactions-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/core_transactions.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/enriched_transactions-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/enriched_transactions-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/enriched_transactions.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/wire_ach_transactions-prod.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/wire_ach_transactions-test.sqrl`, `deposits_payments/transactions/wire_ach_transactions.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/consumer_loans-prod.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/consumer_loans-test.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/consumer_loans.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/credit_cards-prod.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/credit_cards-test.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/credit_cards.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/credit_risk_signals-prod.sqrl`, `lending/cards_consumer_credit/credit_risk_signals-test.sqrl` (+12 more not listed)\n\n<details><summary>README.md</summary>\n\n# Retail Bank Data Catalog\n\nA data catalog covering the **bronze** (source) and **silver** (enriched/conformed) layers of a retail bank's data mesh. Tables are documented as SQRL `CREATE TABLE` definitions using Flink SQL syntax, organized by line of business and team.\n\n## Catalog Index\n\n| Line of Business | Team | Folder | Key Datasets |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Customer | Customer Data | [customer/customer_data/](customer/customer_data/) | Customer master, KYC/AML, Customer profiles |\n| Deposits & Payments | Accounts | [deposits_payments/accounts/](deposits_payments/accounts/) | Deposit accounts, Balances, Account analytics |\n| Deposits & Payments | Transactions | [deposits_payments/transactions/](deposits_payments/transactions/) | Core transactions, Card/Wire/ACH, Enriched transactions |\n| Lending | Mortgages | [lending/mortgages/](lending/mortgages/) | Originations, Servicing, Performance analytics |\n| Lending | Cards & Consumer Credit | [lending/cards_consumer_credit/](lending/cards_consumer_credit/) | Credit cards, Consumer loans, Credit risk signals |\n\n## Classification Levels\n\n| Level | Description |\n|---|---|\n| **Public** | Disclosed publicly or intended for public use |\n| **In\n\n_(README truncated in this inventory \u2014 read the file for the rest.)_\n\n</details>\n\n## `customer` \u2014 SQRL PROJECT\n\n_has a main script / environment package configs_\n\n- Main script: `customer_enriched_pipeline.sqrl`\n- Engines: `flink`, `iceberg`, `duckdb`, `vertx`\n- Consumes shared module(s): `data-catalog`\n- Package configs: `customer_enriched_pipeline-batch-package.json`, `customer_enriched_pipeline-prod-package.json`, `customer_enriched_pipeline-shared-package.json`, `customer_enriched_pipeline-test-package.json`\n- SQRL files: `customer_enriched_pipeline.sqrl`, `customer_enriched_sinks-prod.sqrl`, `customer_enriched_sinks-test.sqrl`\n\n<details><summary>README.md</summary>\n\n# Customer Enrichment Pipeline\n\nA real-time streaming pipeline that produces silver-layer customer data products from bronze-layer source streams. It consolidates customer identity, contact, compliance, and relationship data into queryable `Customer_Profile` and `Customer_Household` tables exposed via GraphQL, REST, and MCP APIs.\n\n## Motivation and Requirements\n\nBanks and financial institutions maintain customer data across multiple authoritative systems \u2014 a core customer master (CDC stream), KYC verification records, AML risk ratings, and PEP screening results. These systems use append-only or CDC event streams, meaning the same customer can appear multiple times as records are updated.\n\nDownstream consumers (analytics, marketing, relationship management, compliance reporting) need:\n\n- **A single, deduplicated customer view** \u2014 one row per customer with the latest identity, contact, and address information.\n- **Compliance enrichment** \u2014 KYC verification status, AML risk rating, and PEP flag attached to each customer record.\n- **Household groupings** \u2014 customers linked via SPOUSE, JOINT_OWNER, or DEPENDENT relationships grouped into households for relationship-level analytics.\n- **\n\n_(README truncated in this inventory \u2014 read the file for the rest.)_\n\n</details>\n\n## `lending` \u2014 SQRL PROJECT\n\n_has a main script / environment package configs_\n\n- Main script: `lending360.sqrl`\n- Engines: `flink`, `postgres`, `kafka`, `vertx`\n- Consumes shared module(s): `data-catalog`\n- Package configs: `lending360-prod-package.json`, `lending360-shared-package.json`, `lending360-test-package.json`\n- SQRL files: `lending360.sqrl`\n\n<details><summary>README.md</summary>\n\n# Lending 360\n\nA customer-facing data application that provides a unified view of all lending instruments a customer holds, including mortgages, consumer loans (personal and auto), and credit cards. Customers can see active balances, terms, and a consolidated payment history across all products.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Mortgage**: Active mortgage loans with key terms (rate, balance, payment, maturity)\n- **CreditCard**: Active credit card accounts with balance, credit limit, APR, and rewards\n- **ConsumerLoan**: Active personal and auto loans in a unified view\n- **Customer**: Basic customer profile without sensitive PII (no SSN, TIN, or date of birth)\n- **ConsolidatedLoanPayments**: All payments across mortgages, consumer loans, and credit cards in one table\n\n## Data Sources\n\nData is sourced from the shared [`data-catalog`](../data-catalog) submodule at the repository root, wired in via `script.include` in `lending360-shared-package.json`:\n- `data-catalog/lending/mortgages` \u2014 mortgage originations and servicing\n- `data-catalog/lending/cards_consumer_credit` \u2014 consumer loans and credit cards\n- `data-catalog/customer/customer_data` \u2014 customer master records\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nlending\n\n_(README truncated in this inventory \u2014 read the file for the rest.)_\n\n</details>\n"}], "isError": false, "durationMs": 12, "timestamp": 1795531314127}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_01a20e0194047c83bfdeefc4", "toolName": "ls", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": ".datasqrl/\n.datasqrl_agent_results.json\nadr/\nAGENTS.md\nbuild/\nloan-payments-api/\nloan-payments-api-test-package.json\nloan-payments-prod-package.json\nloan-payments-shared-package.json\nloan-payments-table-test-package.json\nloan-payments.sqrl\nREADME.md\nrun-tests.sh\nsnapshots/"}], "isError": false, "durationMs": 13, "timestamp": 1795531314127}]}
